{"seq":1,"slug":"git-hooks-and-lefthook","title":"Git Hooks 与 Lefthook","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/ci-cd-and-automation/git-hooks-and-lefthook","wordCount":539,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"git-hooks-与-lefthook\">Git Hooks 与 Lefthook</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Git Hooks 是 Git 在特定事件（如提交、推送）发生时自动执行的脚本。在前端工程化中，Git Hooks 是本地代码质量的&quot;最后一道防线&quot;——确保每一次提交的代码都通过了基本的质量检查。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    EDIT[编辑代码] --&gt; STAGE[git add]&#10;    STAGE --&gt; COMMIT[git commit]&#10;    COMMIT --&gt; PREHOOK[pre-commit Hook&lt;br/&gt;Lint + Format + Type Check]&#10;    PREHOOK --&gt;|通过| MSG[commit-msg Hook&lt;br/&gt;校验提交消息格式]&#10;    MSG --&gt;|通过| DONE[提交成功]&#10;    PREHOOK --&gt;|失败| REJECT1[提交被拒绝]&#10;    MSG --&gt;|失败| REJECT2[提交被拒绝]\">flowchart LR\n    EDIT[编辑代码] --&gt; STAGE[git add]\n    STAGE --&gt; COMMIT[git commit]\n    COMMIT --&gt; PREHOOK[pre-commit Hook&lt;br/&gt;Lint + Format + Type Check]\n    PREHOOK --&gt;|通过| MSG[commit-msg Hook&lt;br/&gt;校验提交消息格式]\n    MSG --&gt;|通过| DONE[提交成功]\n    PREHOOK --&gt;|失败| REJECT1[提交被拒绝]\n    MSG --&gt;|失败| REJECT2[提交被拒绝]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hook</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>pre-commit</code></td>\n<td><code>git commit</code> 前</td>\n<td>Lint、格式化、类型检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>commit-msg</code></td>\n<td>提交消息写入后</td>\n<td>校验 Conventional Commits 格式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pre-push</code></td>\n<td><code>git push</code> 前</td>\n<td>运行测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>post-merge</code></td>\n<td><code>git merge</code> 后</td>\n<td>自动 <code>pnpm install</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>post-checkout</code></td>\n<td><code>git checkout</code> 后</td>\n<td>自动 <code>pnpm install</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"lefthook-配置\">Lefthook 配置</h2><p>Lefthook 是一个用 Go 编写的 Git Hook 管理工具，相比 Husky + lint-staged 的组合，它具有以下优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单一工具替代 Husky + lint-staged 两个工具</li>\n<li>Go 原生执行，启动速度更快</li>\n<li>并行执行多个命令</li>\n<li>原生支持 Monorepo</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"安装\">安装</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pnpm add -D lefthook&#10;npx lefthook install\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -D</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lefthook</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lefthook</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"基础配置\">基础配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# lefthook.yml&#10;pre-commit:&#10;  parallel: true&#10;  commands:&#10;    lint:&#10;      glob: &#39;*.{ts,tsx,js,jsx}&#39;&#10;      run: npx biome check --apply {staged_files}&#10;      stage_fixed: true&#10;    typecheck:&#10;      glob: &#39;*.{ts,tsx}&#39;&#10;      run: npx tsc --noEmit&#10;    test:&#10;      glob: &#39;*.{ts,tsx}&#39;&#10;      run: npx vitest related {staged_files} --run&#10;&#10;commit-msg:&#10;  commands:&#10;    commitlint:&#10;      run: npx commitlint --edit {1}&#10;&#10;pre-push:&#10;  commands:&#10;    test:&#10;      run: pnpm run test --run&#10;    build:&#10;      run: pnpm run build\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># lefthook.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">pre-commit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  parallel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  commands</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    lint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      glob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'*.{ts,tsx,js,jsx}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx biome check --apply {staged_files}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      stage_fixed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    typecheck</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      glob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'*.{ts,tsx}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx tsc --noEmit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      glob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'*.{ts,tsx}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx vitest related {staged_files} --run</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">commit-msg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  commands</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    commitlint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx commitlint --edit {1}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">pre-push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  commands</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm run test --run</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm run build</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"monorepo-配置\">Monorepo 配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# lefthook.yml (Monorepo)&#10;pre-commit:&#10;  parallel: true&#10;  commands:&#10;    lint:&#10;      glob: &#39;*.{ts,tsx,js,jsx}&#39;&#10;      run: npx biome check --apply {staged_files}&#10;      stage_fixed: true&#10;    typecheck-web:&#10;      root: &#39;apps/web/&#39;&#10;      glob: &#39;apps/web/**/*.{ts,tsx}&#39;&#10;      run: npx tsc --noEmit --project tsconfig.json&#10;    typecheck-admin:&#10;      root: &#39;apps/admin/&#39;&#10;      glob: &#39;apps/admin/**/*.{ts,tsx}&#39;&#10;      run: npx tsc --noEmit --project tsconfig.json&#10;    typecheck-ui:&#10;      root: &#39;packages/ui/&#39;&#10;      glob: &#39;packages/ui/**/*.{ts,tsx}&#39;&#10;      run: npx tsc --noEmit --project tsconfig.json&#10;&#10;post-merge:&#10;  commands:&#10;    install:&#10;      run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      glob: &#39;**/pnpm-lock.yaml&#39;&#10;&#10;post-checkout:&#10;  commands:&#10;    install:&#10;      run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      glob: &#39;**/pnpm-lock.yaml&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># lefthook.yml (Monorepo)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">pre-commit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  parallel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  commands</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    lint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      glob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'*.{ts,tsx,js,jsx}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx biome check --apply {staged_files}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      stage_fixed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    typecheck-web</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      root</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'apps/web/'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      glob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'apps/web/**/*.{ts,tsx}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx tsc --noEmit --project tsconfig.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    typecheck-admin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      root</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'apps/admin/'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      glob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'apps/admin/**/*.{ts,tsx}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx tsc --noEmit --project tsconfig.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    typecheck-ui</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      root</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'packages/ui/'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      glob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'packages/ui/**/*.{ts,tsx}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx tsc --noEmit --project tsconfig.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">post-merge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  commands</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    install</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      glob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'**/pnpm-lock.yaml'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">post-checkout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  commands</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    install</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      glob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'**/pnpm-lock.yaml'</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"conventional-commits\">Conventional Commits</h2><p>Conventional Commits 是一种结构化的提交消息格式，为自动化版本管理和 CHANGELOG 生成提供基础。</p>\n<h3 id=\"格式规范\">格式规范</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&lt;type&gt;(&lt;scope&gt;): &lt;description&gt;&#10;&#10;[optional body]&#10;&#10;[optional footer(s)]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;type>(&#x3C;scope>): &#x3C;description></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[optional body]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[optional footer(s)]</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"常用-type\">常用 Type</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Type</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>版本影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>feat</code></td>\n<td>新功能</td>\n<td>Minor (0.x.0)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fix</code></td>\n<td>Bug 修复</td>\n<td>Patch (0.0.x)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>docs</code></td>\n<td>文档更新</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>style</code></td>\n<td>代码风格（不影响功能）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>refactor</code></td>\n<td>重构（不增加功能或修复 Bug）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>perf</code></td>\n<td>性能优化</td>\n<td>Patch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>test</code></td>\n<td>测试相关</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>chore</code></td>\n<td>构建/工具/依赖等</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ci</code></td>\n<td>CI 配置变更</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"commitlint-配置\">commitlint 配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// commitlint.config.ts&#10;import type { UserConfig } from &#39;@commitlint/types&#39;;&#10;&#10;const config: UserConfig = {&#10;  extends: [&#39;@commitlint/config-conventional&#39;],&#10;  rules: {&#10;    &#39;type-enum&#39;: [2, &#39;always&#39;, [&#39;feat&#39;, &#39;fix&#39;, &#39;docs&#39;, &#39;style&#39;, &#39;refactor&#39;, &#39;perf&#39;, &#39;test&#39;, &#39;chore&#39;, &#39;ci&#39;, &#39;revert&#39;]],&#10;    &#39;scope-enum&#39;: [2, &#39;always&#39;, [&#39;web&#39;, &#39;admin&#39;, &#39;ui&#39;, &#39;shared&#39;, &#39;api-client&#39;, &#39;docs&#39;, &#39;ci&#39;]],&#10;    &#39;subject-max-length&#39;: [2, &#39;always&#39;, 72],&#10;    &#39;body-max-line-length&#39;: [2, &#39;always&#39;, 100],&#10;  },&#10;};&#10;&#10;export default config;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// commitlint.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { UserConfig } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@commitlint/types'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserConfig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  extends: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@commitlint/config-conventional'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rules: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'type-enum'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'always'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'feat'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'fix'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'docs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'style'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'refactor'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'perf'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'test'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'chore'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ci'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'revert'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'scope-enum'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'always'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'web'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'admin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ui'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'shared'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'api-client'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'docs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ci'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'subject-max-length'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'always'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">72</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'body-max-line-length'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'always'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>示例提交消息：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"feat(ui): 新增 DatePicker 组件&#10;&#10;实现了基础的日期选择器组件，支持以下功能：&#10;- 单日期选择&#10;- 日期范围选择&#10;- 禁用特定日期&#10;&#10;Closes #123\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">feat(ui</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">): 新增 DatePicker 组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">实现了基础的日期选择器组件，支持以下功能：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">-</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 单日期选择</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">-</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 日期范围选择</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">-</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 禁用特定日期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Closes</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> #123</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"lefthook-vs-husky-lint-staged\">Lefthook vs Husky + lint-staged</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Husky + lint-staged&#10;        H[Husky&lt;br/&gt;Hook 管理] --&gt; LS[lint-staged&lt;br/&gt;暂存文件过滤]&#10;        LS --&gt; CMD1[ESLint]&#10;        LS --&gt; CMD2[Prettier]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Lefthook&#10;        LH[Lefthook&lt;br/&gt;Hook 管理 + 文件过滤&lt;br/&gt;一体化]&#10;        LH --&gt; CMD3[Biome]&#10;        LH --&gt; CMD4[TypeCheck]&#10;        LH --&gt; CMD5[Test]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph Husky + lint-staged\n        H[Husky&lt;br/&gt;Hook 管理] --&gt; LS[lint-staged&lt;br/&gt;暂存文件过滤]\n        LS --&gt; CMD1[ESLint]\n        LS --&gt; CMD2[Prettier]\n    end\n    subgraph Lefthook\n        LH[Lefthook&lt;br/&gt;Hook 管理 + 文件过滤&lt;br/&gt;一体化]\n        LH --&gt; CMD3[Biome]\n        LH --&gt; CMD4[TypeCheck]\n        LH --&gt; CMD5[Test]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Husky + lint-staged</th>\n<th>Lefthook</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>工具数量</td>\n<td>2 个</td>\n<td>1 个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言</td>\n<td>Node.js</td>\n<td>Go（更快）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暂存文件过滤</td>\n<td>lint-staged 提供</td>\n<td>内置 <code>{staged_files}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行执行</td>\n<td>需要配置</td>\n<td>内置 <code>parallel: true</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Monorepo 支持</td>\n<td>需要额外配置</td>\n<td>内置 <code>root</code> 选项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置格式</td>\n<td><code>.husky/</code> + JSON</td>\n<td>单一 YAML 文件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实践建议\">实践建议</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 本地守护&#10;        PRE_COMMIT[pre-commit&lt;br/&gt;Lint + Format&lt;br/&gt;只检查暂存文件]&#10;        COMMIT_MSG[commit-msg&lt;br/&gt;校验提交消息]&#10;        PRE_PUSH[pre-push&lt;br/&gt;Test + Build&lt;br/&gt;完整检查]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph CI 流水线&#10;        CI_LINT[Lint 全量检查]&#10;        CI_TYPE[Type Check]&#10;        CI_TEST[Test 全量]&#10;        CI_BUILD[Build]&#10;    end&#10;    PRE_COMMIT --&gt; COMMIT_MSG&#10;    COMMIT_MSG --&gt; PRE_PUSH&#10;    PRE_PUSH --&gt; CI_LINT\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 本地守护\n        PRE_COMMIT[pre-commit&lt;br/&gt;Lint + Format&lt;br/&gt;只检查暂存文件]\n        COMMIT_MSG[commit-msg&lt;br/&gt;校验提交消息]\n        PRE_PUSH[pre-push&lt;br/&gt;Test + Build&lt;br/&gt;完整检查]\n    end\n    subgraph CI 流水线\n        CI_LINT[Lint 全量检查]\n        CI_TYPE[Type Check]\n        CI_TEST[Test 全量]\n        CI_BUILD[Build]\n    end\n    PRE_COMMIT --&gt; COMMIT_MSG\n    COMMIT_MSG --&gt; PRE_PUSH\n    PRE_PUSH --&gt; CI_LINT</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>pre-commit 应该快</strong>：只检查暂存文件，1-5 秒内完成</li>\n<li><strong>pre-push 可以更全面</strong>：运行测试和构建，10-30 秒可接受</li>\n<li><strong>不要阻塞开发流程</strong>：Hook 太慢会导致开发者用 <code>--no-verify</code> 跳过</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Git Hooks 是本地代码质量的&quot;最后一道防线&quot;。</li>\n<li>Lefthook 是单一的 Go 原生工具，替代 Husky + lint-staged 组合。</li>\n<li>Conventional Commits 为自动化版本管理和 CHANGELOG 生成提供基础。</li>\n<li>pre-commit Hook 应保持快速（1-5 秒），只检查暂存文件。</li>\n<li>本地 Hook 和 CI 流水线是互补关系——前者提供快速反馈，后者提供全面保障。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Git Hooks 与 Lefthook","id":"git-hooks-与-lefthook"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Lefthook 配置","id":"lefthook-配置"},{"level":3,"text":"安装","id":"安装"},{"level":3,"text":"基础配置","id":"基础配置"},{"level":3,"text":"Monorepo 配置","id":"monorepo-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"Conventional Commits","id":"conventional-commits"},{"level":3,"text":"格式规范","id":"格式规范"},{"level":3,"text":"常用 Type","id":"常用-type"},{"level":3,"text":"commitlint 配置","id":"commitlint-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"Lefthook vs Husky + lint-staged","id":"lefthook-vs-husky-lint-staged"},{"level":2,"text":"实践建议","id":"实践建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"服务端状态与缓存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/state-management/server-state-and-caching"},"next":{"title":"GitHub Actions 流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/ci-cd-and-automation/github-actions-pipeline"}}